 "general": {
  "objective": [
   "To send an approved SA from ELIPS to PAS and to apply the PAS feedback (PR / PO number or error) to the SA, as implemented in sa-pas-rules.js.",
   "The approved SA snapshot is never changed; only PAS / integration fields are written (SM-10)."
  ],
  "operation_flow": {
   "flow": {
    "direction": "TB",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "id": "a",
      "label": "Approved SA (SA Approval)",
      "type": "screen"
     },
     {
      "id": "s",
      "label": "Send SA to PAS (system / Retry)",
      "type": "process"
     },
     {
      "id": "p",
      "label": "PAS",
      "type": "db"
     },
     {
      "id": "f",
      "label": "Apply PAS feedback",
      "type": "process"
     },
     {
      "id": "d",
      "label": "ielp.SA_DETAIL",
      "type": "db"
     }
    ],
    "edges": [
     {
      "from": "a",
      "to": "s"
     },
     {
      "from": "s",
      "to": "p"
     },
     {
      "from": "p",
      "to": "f",
      "label": "feedback"
     },
     {
      "from": "f",
      "to": "d"
     },
     {
      "from": "s",
      "to": "d"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "inputs": [
   {
    "name": "ielp.SA_HEADER / ielp.SA_DETAIL",
    "type": "DB",
    "description": "Approved SA"
   },
   {
    "name": "PAS feedback",
    "type": "API / interface",
    "description": "feedbackId, saNo, correlationId, type PR / PO / PR_PO / ERROR, prNo, prDate, poNo, errorCode"
   }
  ],
  "outputs": [
   {
    "name": "ielp.SA_DETAIL",
    "type": "DB",
    "description": "PAS_* columns"
   },
   {
    "name": "ielp.LOG_ITGPAS",
    "type": "DB",
    "description": "Interface log (inferred)"
   }
  ],
  "extra_tables": [
   {
    "title": "Interface status (sa-pas-rules.js STATUS)",
    "columns": [
     {
      "title": "Status",
      "width": 10
     },
     {
      "title": "Meaning",
      "width": 30
     }
    ],
    "rows": [
     [
      "NOT_SENT",
      "Approved, not sent"
     ],
     [
      "PROCESSING",
      "Sending"
     ],
     [
      "SENT",
      "Sent - waiting PAS"
     ],
     [
      "PR_RECEIVED",
      "PAS PR number received"
     ],
     [
      "PO_RECEIVED",
      "PAS PO received without PR"
     ],
     [
      "COMPLETED",
      "PR and PO received"
     ],
     [
      "FAILED",
      "Send or PAS step failed"
     ]
    ]
   }
  ],
  "constraints": [
   "SA number format ^ILS/TR/[A-Z0-9]{2,5}/\\d{6}\\d{4}$ (sa-pas-rules.js SA_RE) is longer than SA_CODE varchar(16) - G-SA-01 (DCR: SA_CODE widened, existing logic kept).",
   "Status code values stored in SA_DETAIL.PAS_STATUS varchar(100): TBD - Not confirmed from existing schema/data/code"
  ]
 },
 "func_flow": {
  "flow": {
   "direction": "TB",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "id": "s",
     "label": "START",
     "type": "start"
    },
    {
     "id": "c",
     "label": "Sendable? (NOT_SENT / FAILED, retry right)",
     "type": "decision",
     "step": 1
    },
    {
     "id": "v",
     "label": "Validate SA data",
     "type": "process",
     "step": 2
    },
    {
     "id": "x",
     "label": "Call PAS, correlation id",
     "type": "process",
     "step": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "r",
     "label": "Result: SENT / FAILED + log",
     "type": "process",
     "step": 4
    },
    {
     "id": "f",
     "label": "Feedback: validate, apply, log",
     "type": "process",
     "step": 5
    },
    {
     "id": "e",
     "label": "END",
     "type": "end"
    }
   ],
   "edges": [
    {
     "from": "s",
     "to": "c"
    },
    {
     "from": "c",
     "to": "v",
     "label": "Yes"
    },
    {
     "from": "v",
     "to": "x"
    },
    {
     "from": "x",
     "to": "r"
    },
    {
     "from": "r",
     "to": "f"
    },
    {
     "from": "f",
     "to": "e"
    }
   ]
  },
  "steps": [
   "Check the SA can be sent: status NOT_SENT or FAILED; a retry by a user needs the retry authorization (IELP Admin in the mock-up); FAILED after PAS data was returned cannot be resent (log 1-3).",
   "Validate SA number format, at least one detail, total cost > 0; otherwise FAILED INVALID_REQUEST (log 4).",
   "Set a stable correlation id ELIPS-SA-<SA number>, attempts + 1, status PROCESSING; call PAS.",
   "PAS error: FAILED with error code / message (log 5); success: SENT with interface time (log 6).",
   "Feedback: mandatory fields, duplicate feedback id ignored, unknown SA, correlation / not-sent checks, PR / PO number and date checks, uniqueness of PAS PR (and optionally PO); apply values, status PR_RECEIVED / PO_RECEIVED / COMPLETED or FAILED for error feedback; every event logged (log 7-14).",
   "Overdue (visual only): SENT / PR_RECEIVED / PO_RECEIVED without feedback for more than the limit (24 h TBD) is highlighted on SA Monitoring (SM-14)."
  ]
 },
